# NikoPay Lightning: standing orders

- Mission: **Lightning BTC → RWF MoMo** for NikoPay with ~1s LN finality on the crypto leg.
- Before coding: read `AGENTS.md`, then skills `nikopay-architecture` and `lightning-rwf-offramp`.
- Source of truth: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/OFFRAMP_FLOW.md`, `docs/PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md`, `docs/ROADMAP.md`, `docs/CODING_STANDARDS.md`.
- Default path: **LND + hold invoices + MoMo Disbursements**. Not BitGo-first. Not Taproot-Assets-first.
- Place code under `services/*` and `packages/*` as documented.
- Never commit macaroons, TLS keys, or MoMo secrets.
- UX: distinguish **Bitcoin received** from **RWF delivered**.
- Code quality: obey `.cursor/rules/coding-quality.mdc`. No comments (NatSpec on Solidity only), typed boundaries, efficient hot paths.
- Voice/UI: obey `voice-and-copy.mdc` and `frontend-ui.mdc`. No em dashes, no AI filler, no Title Case spam, no invented themes. Match NikoPay.
